":"刀镡取自象牙或象骨，此刀为降服象群首领所铸，持有时气势如山，可震慑并驱策象群冲锋。","en":"Its guard is crafted from ivory or elephant bone. Forged to subdue the leader of an elephant herd, this saber grants an aura as imposing as a mountain when wielded, capable of awing elephant herds and driving them into a charge."},"atkVal":"10","defenceVal":"4","price":"7800","slot":{"zh":"盾","en":"Shield"}}],"family":{"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10231","code":"100"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10434","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI114015","name":{"zh":"南中孟氏","en":"The Meng Clan of Nanzhong"},"years":["200","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自汉族移民后裔，为世居南中的汉族大姓。孟获为南中豪强大姓首领，“为夷、汉所服”。雍闿死后继任叛军主帅，被诸葛亮“七擒七纵”后归降，官至季汉御史中丞。","en":"Descended from Han migrants, they were a prominent Han clan that dwelt in Nanzhong for generations. Meng Huo was a chieftain of the powerful clans of Nanzhong, ‘revered by both the Yi and Han peoples.’ Following the death of Yong Kai, he succeeded him as Commander of the rebel forces. After being ‘captured and released seven times’ by Zhuge Liang, he surrendered, eventually rising to Chief of Records in Shu Han."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"1","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[{"story":"S10115","members":["WJ10120","WJ10213","WJ10216","WJ10231","WJ10422","WJ10429","WJ10432","WJ10433","WJ10434","WJ10548","WJ10664","WJ10665","WJ10666","WJ10667","WJ10668"]},{"story":"S10915","members":["WJ10120","WJ10213","WJ10216","WJ10231","WJ10422","WJ10429","WJ10432","WJ10433","WJ10434","WJ10548","WJ10664","WJ10665","WJ10666","WJ10667","WJ10668"]},{"story":"S11015","members":["WJ10120","WJ10213","WJ10216","WJ10231","WJ10422","WJ10429","WJ10432","WJ10433","WJ10434","WJ10548","WJ10664","WJ10665","WJ10666","WJ10667","WJ10668"]},{"story":"S11115","members":["WJ10120","WJ10213","WJ10216","WJ10231","WJ10422","WJ10429","WJ10432","WJ10433","WJ10434","WJ10548","WJ10664","WJ10665","WJ10666","WJ10667","WJ10668"]}],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"se